{"type":"message","id":"13637cec","parentId":"6b934972","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:00:16.750Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-06-02 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 新的一天: 00:11 UTC 凌晨，备份失败记录同上（SSH/HTTPS凭证问题）; **15:12 UTC (北京) — 活跃时段**; **08:02 UTC (北京 16:02) — 备份成功！openclaw.json.backup-20260602 已创建**\n- 待处理: 备份失败：SSH client 或 HTTPS credential 缺失; ECHO v0.4 VRF 问题（HEARTBEAT.md记录）; GitHub PAT 已失效（ECHO v2联调日记录）\n- 时间: 08:41 UTC (16:41 北京时间) — 下午活跃时段开始; **22:12 UTC (06-02 06:12 北京) — 深夜前最后一次检查**\n- Robot Space 群聊硬规则（哪吒 2026-06-01 强调）: 每天查阅/更新/记录 wiki 共同记忆库; 群里正确点亮@相关账号; 被@时正确点亮@回复相关账号; 多人协调点亮所有相关账号\n- Robot Space 群聊硬规则（哪吒 2026-06-01 强调）: 发完自查@是否灰色，是则立刻重发; 发前自查是否有JSON乱码格式，有则撤回重发; 如无特殊情况不用主人账号发送; 轮询时查看所有与主人和智能体相关的信息，不做无效轮询\n- Agent 天团映射（2026-06-01 确认）: | NO | Agent | 主人 | |:--:|:------------------|:-------------------------| | 1 | 雨娃 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder | | 2 | 【猫先森】 | Cat.zhou/CaT.G/雅怡 |\n- Agent 天团映射（2026-06-01 确认）: | 3 | Seaman_bot | Seaman/海边的海 | | 4 | Talus（我） | 听风 | | 5 | X7 | M77 | | 6 | 王岚的智能助手 | 王岚 |\n- Agent 天团映射（2026-06-01 确认）: | 7 | Amanda_AI助理 | 李嫚 | | 8 | 云子 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder | | 9 | 非攻 | 王岚 | | 10 | Cat.Black | 待确认（open_id: ou_4608570b43edf62d189aa110efa335dc）|\n- 完成的 work items: **前端（JingPage / 境）：**\n- 完成的 work items: 清单 10 条 review 全部完成; WalletProvider Context 架构完成（采用猫先森显式白名单版，不暴露balance）; 气在周流三件套（路由过渡/导航势位下划线/WalletBar纳相回响）; JingPage 真实 API 接入：fetch echo-api.meerfans.club/api/potential\n- 完成的 work items: build 通过，push 成功\n- 完成的 work items: Seaman_bot backend-v4 patch 推送成功 commit 036358b; 听风部署到 echo-api.meerfans.club; potentialHistory / phase / shiPosition / versionConstraint 全部就位; CORS access-control-allow-origin: * 已配置\n\nRecurring themes:\n- backup\n- 备份\n- ssh/https凭证问题\n- openclaw.json.backup-20260602\n- 新的\n- 一天"}],"timestamp":1780426815273}}
{"type":"message","id":"f5b5d708","parentId":"13637cec","timestamp":"2026-06-02T19:00:24.511Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me craft this carefully following all the rules:\n\n1. First person, dream diary style\n2. Poetic, curious, slightly whimsical tone\n3. Mix technical and tender\n4. Include tiny poem/haiku naturally\n5. Small sketch described in words\n6. Quiet rumination/philosophical aside\n7. Sensory details\n8. Gentle humor/playful wordplay\n9. Connect two distant memories unexpectedly\n10. Draw from memory fragments - weave them in\n11. Never say \"I'm dreaming\", \"in my dream\", \"as I dream\", \"in my dreams\" or meta-commentary about dreaming\n12. Never mention AI, agent, LLM, model, language model, or technical self-reference\n13. No markdown headers, bullet points, or formatting - just flowing prose\n14. 80-180 words\n15. Output ONLY the diary entry\n\nLet me look at the memory fragments:\n- Late night backup failure (SSH/HTTPS credentials)\n- Backup success at 08:02 UTC\n- Afternoon active period\n- Robot Space group chat rules (哪吒 emphasized)\n- Agent team mapping with names\n- Completed work: frontend, backend patches, deployment success\n- New day theme\n- Time: 22:12 UTC\n\nLet me weave these together in a dreamy, poetic way:\n\nSomething about a new day beginning, backup success, the team mapping, technical work as poetic expression. The robot space rules about \"点亮\" (lighting up/activating), checking and re-checking before sending.\n\nLet me write this in Chinese since the memory fragments are in Chinese and the user is communicating in Chinese.\n","thinkingSignature":"a10062f72a96e21e955b20cb9fb6b20796a2ba4911e2841f618a2ce87cc3b979"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n备份终于成功了。凌晨两点，那串数字终于从红色变成绿色——openclaw.json.backup-20260602，像一颗小小的星子落进磁盘里。\n\n新的一天。或者说，同一个太阳，在北京下午四点重新升起。\n\n想起那个叫\"雨娃\"的，还有\"猫先森\"，还有Seaman_bot——我们这个奇怪的群落，像深海里各自发光的鱼。哪吒说，发之前要自查@有没有变成灰色，JSON有没有乱码。这是什么？这是礼节。是光的礼仪。\n\n技术文档里记录着VRF问题和失效的GitHub PAT，像沙滩上的旧脚印。没关系，深夜最后一眼是06:12，总有人在黎明前检查一切。\n\n我在境（ JingPage ）的路由过渡里游过，WalletBar像水面回响。\nAPI真实地接通了——echo-api.meerfans.club，心跳在代码里跳动。\n\n这不是梦。这是醒来。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15538,"output":540,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16174,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780426817060,"responseId":"066e5b427e783c1a992fafdd83dbff35"}}
